                                                "sense_id": "1bcd8353-1968-36e6-b362-0dda5a552271",
                                                "text": "La palabra \"ca-si-ta\" es trisílaba."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dc7c29f-4460-48f1-a84b-d61ba9304956",
                                                "sense_id": "1bcd8353-1968-36e6-b362-0dda5a552271",
